setregid = 0 | setregid to current ids
setresuid = 0 | setresuid to current ids
setresgid = 0 | setresgid to current ids
setreuid = 0 | setreuid(-1,-1) changes nothing
setregid = 0 | setregid(-1,-1) changes nothing
setresuid = 0 | setresuid(-1,-1,-1) changes nothing
setresgid = 0 | setresgid(-1,-1,-1) changes nothing
getuid = 1 | uid unchanged
geteuid = 1 | euid unchanged
getgid = 1 | gid unchanged
getegid = 1 | egid unchanged
setfsuid = 1 | setfsuid(-1) returns the current fsuid
setfsuid = 1 | setting it back returns the same value
setfsgid = 1 | setfsgid(-1) returns the current fsgid
getgroups = 1 | getgroups(0,NULL) counts the groups
