setgroups = 1 | setgroups to the empty set succeeds or is EPERM
getgroups = 1 | getgroups still works after setgroups
getsid = 1 | getsid(0) is a valid session
getsid = 1 | getsid(self) == getsid(0)
getsid = -ESRCH | getsid of an absent pid is ESRCH
